  "labelNotes": "Column placement (TYP vs MAX) checked with pdftotext -layout on pages 5-6. Supply range from ROC (VIN 2.2-5.5 V); the identical EC 'Input voltage' row (TA = 25C) is not labelled again. IQ 12/25 uA sits on a line without the parameter name, cited by its test-condition cell 'VEN = 1.2V, IOUT = 0mA', which also appears on the IG (14 uA) line. Ground current IG (14 uA at IOUT = 0 mA, 50 uA at IOUT = 100 mA) counted as a supply current. IEN 5.5 uA TYP is the EN input current set by the internal 1 MOhm EN pull-down (footnote 10); still an EN-pin input current, so labelled. VEN conditions dropped (not an allowed key). Abs max: VIN 6 V and VEN 6 V collapse to one label; VOUT 'See' skipped. RAD (230 Ohm) and the EN 1 MOhm resistor are pull-downs, so recommended_pullup_ohm is ABSENT."
